<!--
  Launcher icon for the music shortcut (both the pinned one and the static entry
  in res/xml/shortcuts.xml): the audio-file note in the same purple as
  ic_file_audio.
  ★ The colour is a **literal** fillColor, not android:tint — a launcher loading
  this by resource drops the tint, which is exactly why ic_music_note (plain
  white, drawn for the dark action strip and the notification small icon) and
  even ic_file_audio (white paths + a purple tint) both arrived on the desktop as
  a white glyph. See ShortcutIcons.
-->
